emma":"பரி","gloss":"scurrying"}],"gloss":"scurrying"},{"surface":"துறைவனொடு","parts":[{"text":"துறைவனொடு","lemma":"துறைவன்","gloss":"lord of the shore (with)"}],"gloss":"with the lord of the shore"},{"surface":"ஒருநாள்","parts":[{"text":"ஒரு","lemma":"ஒரு","gloss":"one"},{"text":"நாள்","lemma":"நாள்","gloss":"day"}],"gloss":"one day"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"நக்கு","parts":[{"text":"நக்கு","lemma":"நகு","gloss":"having smiled"}],"gloss":"having smiled"},{"surface":"விளையாடலும்","parts":[{"text":"விளையாடலும்","lemma":"விளையாடல்","gloss":"playing (and)"}],"gloss":"and playing"},{"surface":"கடிந்தன்","parts":[{"text":"கடிந்தன்","lemma":"கடிந்தன்று","gloss":"has forbidden"}],"gloss":"has forbidden"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"றைதே","parts":[{"text":"றைதே","lemma":"ஐதே","gloss":"it is a wonder/alas"}],"gloss":"alas"},{"surface":"கம்ம","parts":[{"text":"கம்ம","lemma":"கம்ம","gloss":"particle of sorrow"}],"gloss":"particle of sorrow"},{"surface":"மெய்தோய்","parts":[{"text":"மெய்","lemma":"மெய்","gloss":"body"},{"text":"தோய்","lemma":"தோய்","gloss":"touching"}],"gloss":"body-touching"},{"surface":"நட்பே","parts":[{"text":"நட்பு","lemma":"நட்பு","gloss":"friendship/love"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"intimate love"}]}],"literal":"Beautiful flowers of adumbu mixed with neythal / worn as a long garland on water-dripping hair / by girls playing ōrai who feared the wet crab / scurrying in the sea; with the lord of such a shore, one day / laughing and playing has been forbidden / alas, our body-touching love!","translation":"Our mother has forbidden us from laughing and playing, even for a single day, with the lord of the shore where wet crabs, feared by girls playing ōrai, scurry into the sea—the shore where we wear long garlands of beautiful adumbu flowers woven with neythal on our water-dripping hair. Alas, what will happen to our intimate, body-touching love?","modern":"அடும்பின் அழகிய மலர்களை நெய்தல் மலர்களுடன் கலந்து தொடுத்த நீண்ட மாலையை, நீர் வடியும் கூந்தலில் அணிந்து கொண்டு, ஓரை விளையாடும் பெண்கள் அஞ்சும்படி ஈரமான மணலில் ஓடும் நண்டுகள் கடலுக்குள் ஓடி மறையும் துறைமுகத் தலைவனுடன், ஒரு நாள் கூட சிரித்து விளையாடுவதை அன்னை தடுத்துவிட்டாள். ஐயோ, உடலால் தழுவிக்கொண்ட எங்களது நெருக்கமான நட்பு இனி என்னாகுமோ!","explanation":"The heroine is speaking to her confidante after her mother has confined her to the house, preventing her from meeting her lover, the lord of the maritime shore. She recalls the joyful days when they used to play on the beach, wearing garlands of adumbu and neythal flowers on their wet hair. She mentions how the girls playing the ōrai game would be frightened by the wet crabs scurrying into the sea. Now, even a single day of laughing and playing with him is forbidden by her mother. She laments the sudden end to their deep, physical and emotional intimacy.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.54],[0.54,1.2],[1.2,1.5],[1.5,1.7],[1.7,2.85],[2.97,3.1],[3.1,3.9],[3.9,4.1],[4.1,5.0],[5.0,5.4],[5.4,6.0],[6.1,6.2],[6.2,7.3],[7.3,7.5],[7.5,7.73],[7.73,8.7],[8.7,9.1],[9.1,9.8],[9.8,10.1],[10.1,11.1],[11.1,11.23],[11.23,11.4],[11.4,12.2]],"female":[[0.0,0.62],[0.62,1.3],[1.3,1.6],[1.6,1.7],[1.7,3.08],[3.08,3.08],[3.08,4.1],[4.1,4.3],[4.3,5.4],[5.4,5.7],[5.7,5.8],[5.8,5.8],[5.8,7.8],[7.8,8.1],[8.1,8.26],[8.26,9.3],[11.93,12.8],[12.8,12.8],[12.8,12.8],[12.8,12.8],[12.8,12.8],[12.8,13.5],[13.5,13.8]]}}